    differentiation: "Serum CEA misses up to 70% of recurrences and ctDNA says whether and when but not where: a positive ctDNA result with negative imaging is a management dilemma, not an answer. A CEACAM5 tracer competes with FDG PET/CT, not with the blood tests, and its case is specificity in an abdomen full of physiological FDG uptake.",
