    differentiation: "There is no approved companion diagnostic, no validated plasma or ctDNA assay, and circulating-tumour-cell TROP2 does not agree with tissue. A quantitative digital-pathology score has separated responders in lung cancer but remains investigational and has no role in breast cancer today. An imaging agent would therefore be competing against nothing, which is both the opportunity and the reason reimbursement would be hard.",
